     * decimals, null for none; so are the proof threshold and the note threshold. Each entry of the permission matrix (open, settle,
     * void, reassign, close, reopen) is the roles that may take the action as written, comma separated; null
     * when blank (the standing rule). The entry date is a date (yyyy-mm-dd), null when blank (off). The grace
     * days of grades A, B and C are a number of days, null for a grade with none; the proof thresholds of
     * grades A, B and C are figures with two decimals, null for a grade with none (it uses the sheet's). The
     * pot is a figure with two decimals, null for none; it is not dated. The parent is the id of the parent
     * sheet, null for none; it is not dated. The fiscal start month is the month (1 to 12) the sheet's fiscal
     * year starts in; it is not dated. The alert threshold is a figure with two decimals, null when off; it is not dated.
     * The rounding mode is half-up or half-even, null for none (the policy date decides); it is dated.
     */
    public record SettingsView(String clerkLimit, String floor, String terms, String termsA, String termsB,
            String termsC, String latePct, String policyDate, String periodNumberingFrom, String graceDays,
            String cap, String proofThreshold, String noteThreshold, String permOpen, String permSettle, String permVoid, String permReassign,
            String permClose, String permReopen, String entryDate, String graceA, String graceB, String graceC,
            String proofThresholdA, String proofThresholdB, String proofThresholdC, String pot, String parent,
            String fiscalStartMonth, String alertThreshold, String rounding, String reviewThreshold) {

        static SettingsView of(DatedSettings dated, LocalDate today, LocalDate policyDate, LocalDate periodNumberingFrom,
                Integer graceDays, LocalDate entryDate) {
            return new SettingsView(text(dated.clerkLimit(today)), dated.floor(today).toPlainString(),
                    Integer.toString(dated.terms(today)), text(dated.gradeTerms("A", today)),
                    text(dated.gradeTerms("B", today)), text(dated.gradeTerms("C", today)),
                    dated.latePct(today).toPlainString(),
                    policyDate == null ? null : policyDate.toString(),
                    periodNumberingFrom == null ? null : periodNumberingFrom.toString(), text(graceDays),
                    text(dated.cap(today)), text(dated.proofThreshold(today)), text(dated.noteThreshold(today)),
                    perm(dated, Permission.OPEN, today), perm(dated, Permission.SETTLE, today),
                    perm(dated, Permission.VOID, today), perm(dated, Permission.REASSIGN, today),
                    perm(dated, Permission.CLOSE, today), perm(dated, Permission.REOPEN, today),
                    entryDate == null ? null : entryDate.toString(), text(grace(dated, "A", today)),
                    text(grace(dated, "B", today)), text(grace(dated, "C", today)),
                    text(dated.gradeProofThreshold("A", today)), text(dated.gradeProofThreshold("B", today)),
                    text(dated.gradeProofThreshold("C", today)), text(dated.pot()), dated.parent(),
                    Integer.toString(dated.fiscalStartMonth()), text(dated.alertThreshold()),
                    dated.on(DatedSettings.ROUNDING, today).orElse(null), text(dated.reviewThreshold(today)));
        }

        /** The grade's grace days in force on the date as written; null when it has none then. */
        private static String grace(DatedSettings dated, String grade, LocalDate today) {
            return dated.on(DatedSettings.gradeGraceKey(grade), today).orElse(null);
        }

        private static String perm(DatedSettings dated, Permission permission, LocalDate today) {
            return dated.on(permission.key(), today).orElse(null);
        }

        private static String text(Object value) {
            return value == null ? null : value instanceof BigDecimal d ? d.toPlainString() : value.toString();
        }
    }

    /** A delegation of the steward role: the user, the steward who delegated, and its dates (yyyy-mm-dd), inclusive. */
    public record DelegationView(long id, String user, String by, String from, String to) {

        static DelegationView of(Delegation d) {
            return new DelegationView(d.getId(), d.getUserName(), d.getDelegatedBy(), d.getFromDate().toString(),
                    d.getToDate().toString());
